abstract: >-
  An open, zero-install browser simulation of a security operations center for a
  healthcare environment that uses LLM agents and federated learning. It includes six
  attack scenarios mapped to MITRE ATT&CK and MITRE ATLAS, a five-class threat taxonomy
  for clinical AI agents, a deterministic synthetic labeled event dataset, and transparent
  baseline detection rules with an evaluation harness.
